tle":"Add zikiai\u0027s profile photo","messageBody":"The About Us page lacks zikiai\u0027s profile and portrait.\n\nAdd the supplied photo and GitHub profile link so readers can\nidentify this team member. Use the lowercase username filename\nrequired by the course.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":8,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"065ccc4048cefa2a3382f7e0e09a3c6edf456ab8","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update zikiai\u0027s team roles and responsibilities","messageBody":"The About Us entry lists zikiai only as a developer.\n\nRecord the agreed team lead and integration responsibilities,\nalong with backup responsibility for the Logic component.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":3,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"acabbf828e74732f52a1ad1eeb2d4dfe5671f370","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Point README badge to the team build workflow","messageBody":"The README badge reports the upstream AB3 project\u0027s build status.\n\nPoint the badge to the team\u0027s Java CI workflow on master and link\nto its workflow page so readers can check TutorLah\u0027s build status.\n\nFixes #22\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":1,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"b8360dc22af5b43611f0a01d89689cfd5c14f092","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add a dedicated acknowledgements section","messageBody":"The README describes the project as part of SE-EDU rather than\ncrediting the code that TutorLah builds on.\n\nAdd a separate acknowledgements section linking to AddressBook-Level3\nand SE-EDU so the attribution remains distinct from project content.\n\nFixes #23\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":4,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"9718a2410474aa67d8370438ec218a47f3823d4e","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Rewrite README content for TutorLah","messageBody":"The README still presents the application as an AB3 sample project.\n\nDescribe TutorLah\u0027s intended users and proposed MVP, distinguish\nplanned features from existing behaviour, and link the team\u0027s\nproject documentation. Preserve the badge and acknowledgements.\n\nFixes #24\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":21,"deletions":11}}}]},{"date":"2026-10-01T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"22af25a31d2c152c6b9e45d0942cd6f54637e75c","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update TutorLah website branding and navigation","messageBody":"The website retains AB3 guide headings, upstream repository links,\nand an incorrect Command Summary navigation target.\n\nUse TutorLah guide headings and documentation metadata, point the\nnavigation and badges to the team repository, and correct the\nCommand Summary link. Preserve technical names and source credits.\n\nFixes #25\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":6,"deletions":6}}},{"hash":"dbf40178572a983bf724c91b4d5f12b9c819c224","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #38 from cibichandar/36-add-cibichandar-profile-photo","messageBody":"Add cibichandar\u0027s profile photo","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"f4579f37473ddb720914dd7ec9d78165a957f9d4","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #31 from fuhlie/update-fuhlie-about-us","messageBody":"Update fuhlie\u0027s About Us details","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"6eae6282968d63a50dba8854aab90322d00f7ce2","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #41 from cibichandar/40-update-aboutus-cibichandar","messageBody":"Update AboutUs with cibichandar details","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-10-04T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"93bda045e948d871389f5393e7915842572f5a34","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #47 from srivatsanj27/dg-use-cases","messageBody":"Add TutorLah use cases to Developer Guide","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]}],"cibichandar":[{"date":"2026-10-01T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"731c04f3a72a294f910e08aa43a36dd1bcc93853","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update AboutUs with cibic